# Endonym/exonym/glossonym are defined in the names module (gmeow:NamePurpose
# value vocabulary). Languages reference them, they are not redeclared here.
gmeow:changeMerger skos:definition "The merger language change type — a kind of diachronic process that alters a language's form, lexicon, or social standing."@x-gmeow-english ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/languages> .

# =========================================================================== #
# OBSERVATION-SPINE BRIDGES (slice-dependency doctrine dependency refactor)
# Declared HERE, in the slice that owns these properties: a dependent slice
# knows the core observation spine; the spine never knows the slice. The
# super-properties (observedFeature / vantage / observationResult) live in
# the observations module.
# =========================================================================== #
# LanguageState bridges (declared here because the super-properties live here).
gmeow:stateLanguage rdfs:subPropertyOf gmeow:observedFeature .
gmeow:stateAuthority rdfs:subPropertyOf gmeow:vantage .
